Z||000005||mwbackus||10-12-1999||03:05 PM||||500.. this does not surprise me at all!  Consider that there are NO other correspondence sources like this that have a constantly updated "searchable" archive of posts!  On the mailing lists, answers to some very interesting questions and topics go unanswered, or at least they appear to, since many are addressed via private email.  Here, you will never see an "unsubscribe" post, and you need not worry when you take a long vacation, since your email will not overflow.  But the most obvious reason for this forums popularity is the friendly,  knowledgable people that hang out here! :-)<P>Mike||||reg||1
Z||000006||fiero56||10-13-1999||10:09 AM||||That's why I left the <A HREF="http://www.fiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.org</A>  mailing list after a year of being on it.  There was just too much personal bashing going on, and no Fiero talk.  I was learing nothing, and no-one ever responded to posts anymore.  You guys are a lot better.  Shaun knows what I'm talking about, he's on it also.||||reg||10
